"Skittles","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1503956462,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>OxygeN</strong></cite><p>//EDIT: You can&#x27;t really see the full oxygen once set as avatar<br></p></blockquote><p>That is because the picture is not a 4:3 resolution</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>edit: Unless <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1749-cybertronix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@CyberTroniX</a> is gonna fix it in a better way, here&#x27;s a quick (maybe bad?) fix:<br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":71175,"threadID":4726,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1503962816,"lastEditTime":1503963672,"editCount":2,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":1749,"editor":"CyberTroniX","likes":[{"userID":2543,"username":"Skittles","time":1503963392,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1503963743,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I now remade the picture you favoured. (Version 2)<br>I opened a new document in PS with 192x192 as setting.<br>This time it should fit nicely.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=43beba-1503963642.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>There&#x27;s another one I made, just because I had time. Choose which one suits you.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=29a745-1503962633.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":71176,"threadID":4726,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1503963985,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1503964033,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Thank you for people that created a avatar for me <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2223-nekocedx3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@NekoCedx3</a> and <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1749-cybertronix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@CyberTroniX</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>You guys put a effort into making a avatar for me and want nothing in return, you guys created something no one did for me before, all of them look great and I will surely use them all or at least try to use them.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Seeing them avatars being created brought a smile to my face, there is no words to explain how good they look.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hope you guys have a great night and day today, keep the smile and enjoy the gaming.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":71196,"threadID":4726,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1504038425,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1504104075,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I don&#x27;t know if this is the right place to do this, but I created another avatar for a friend and thought I&#x27;ll show it (off <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span> ) to you guys.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>So if someone wants some avatar, I&#x27;m taking gladly any requests just for passing time <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> <br>(Still have to see if I&#x27;m able to do it, since I&#x27;m new to this and if I have the required time.)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>&quot;Wallpaper&quot;:<br><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=91f1e9-1504038360.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Steam Avatar (That&#x27;s why the res is low.):<br><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.p